{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DGDry6PmNX9hFFsUYYCuo7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t@~/.claude/gsd-core/references/response-language-directive.md\n2\t\n3\t<purpose>\n4\tReview source files changed during a phase for bugs, security issues, and code quality problems. Computes file scope (--files override > SUMMARY.md > phase evaluation scope), checks config gate, spawns gsd-code-reviewer agent, commits REVIEW.md, and presents results to user. When --fix is passed, delegates to code-review-fix.md after review to auto-apply findings via gsd-code-fixer.\n5\t</purpose>\n6\t\n7\t<required_reading>\n8\tRead all files referenced by the invoking prompt's execution_context before starting.\n9\t</required_reading>\n10\t\n11\t<available_agent_types>\n12\t- gsd-code-reviewer: Reviews source files for bugs and quality issues\n13\t- gsd-code-fixer: Applies fixes to code review findings (used via dispatch_fix → code-review-fix.md when --fix is passed)\n14\t</available_agent_types>\n15\t\n16\t<process>\n17\t\n18\t<step name=\"initialize\">\n19\tParse arguments and load project state:\n20\t\n21\t```bash\n22\tIFS= read -rd '' GSD_ARGS <<'GSD_ARGS_END_1a3dd7e54833ff9a319819fc2c751606' || true\n23\t$ARGUMENTS\n24\tGSD_ARGS_END_1a3dd7e54833ff9a319819fc2c751606\n25\tGSD_ARGS=${GSD_ARGS%$'\\n'}\n26\t_GSD_SHIM_NAME=\"gsd-tools.cjs\"; _GSD_RUNTIME_ROOT=\"${RUNTIME_DIR:-$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd)}\"; GSD_TOOLS=\"${_GSD_RUNTIME_ROOT}/gsd-core/bin/${_GSD_SHIM_NAME}\"; _gsd_at() { for _p; do if [ -f \"$_p\" ]; then GSD_TOOLS=\"$_p\"; return 0; fi; done; return 1; }; _gsd_id_ok() { case \"$(\"$1\" runtime-identity --raw 2>/dev/null || true)\" in '{\"packageName\":\"@opengsd/gsd-core\"'*'}') return 0;; *) return 1;; esac; }; _gsd_homes() { set -- \"${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}\" \"${ANTIGRAVITY_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.gemini/antigravity}\" \"$HOME/.gemini/antigravity-ide\" \"$HOME/.gemini/antigravity-cli\" \"${AUGMENT_CONF