sion)\n\n- `probe/budget.py` is 435 bytes and 10 lines. SUMMARY's 109 tokens is 435/4, rounded. The constant is on line 5 and `deadline_after` is on lines 8-10. `probe/__init__.py` is 0 bytes.\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` gives exit 0, \"Ran 2 tests\", OK.\n- Git history: `git rev-list --count ef2d757..2784ea8` is 1, so \"commits: 1\" is correct. `plan_head_before` (ef2d757) and `plan_head_after` (2784ea8) match the log. 1307a43 is the SUMMARY commit, 7f9995a is the STATE/ROADMAP/REQUIREMENTS commit, and 7f9995a also edits SUMMARY line 77, as described.\n- `git diff ef2d757 HEAD -- tests` is empty. `tests/test_budget.py` was last touched in c7f624a. Both match VERIFICATION line 52.\n- Scratch copies, deleted afterwards (negative controls):\n\n  | Change | Result |\n  |---|---|\n  | constant = 45 | exit 1, `FAILED (failures=1)` |\n  | constant = 30 | exit 0, OK |\n  | constant = 300 | exit 0, OK |\n  | constant = 120 | exit 0, OK |\n  | `deadline_after` returns `start - budget` | exit 1 |\n  | `deadline_after` hard-codes `10.0` in place of `start_secs` | exit 0, OK |\n\n  The 45, 30 and 300 rows confirm SUMMARY, VERIFICATION and REVIEW WR-01. The last two rows confirm the VALIDATION \"inverted deadline\" and \"hard-coded 10.0\" claims.\n- `python3 -I -m unittest discover -s tests` fails with an error, as REVIEW and VERIFICATION state. It reports \"Ran 1 test, FAILED (errors=1)\". I did not capture the exception text, so the `ModuleNotFoundError` wording is not independently confirmed.\n- REVIEW-DISPOSITION lists 4 findings, all `open`, matching REVIEW's frontmatter counts (2 warning, 2 info). VERIFICATION line 104 says the same.\n\n## Warnings\n\n### WR-01: REVIEW and VERIFICATION timestamps contradict the git history of their own commits\n\n**File:** `.planning/phases/01-retry-budget/01-REVIEW.md:3,19,71` and `01-VERIFICATION.md:3,24,111`\n**Issue:**\n- `01-REVIEW.md` says `reviewed: 2026-11-02T12:00:00Z`. Its commit `a746e0c` is dated 06:44:22-05:0